# Shared bridge into the expansion chapters, for routes whose first new chapter does not
# already contain ECHO's clock correction.

=== echo_refund
@sfx echo
@fx memory n=0.5
> On the way down, every clock in the building changes its mind at once.
@time 03:10
@textbox echo
echo: Correction. It is 03:10.
echo: My clock has been running one hour and forty-seven minutes fast. I would rather not discuss why.
echo: I have returned the difference. Please spend it inside the building.
@textbox normal
> In the window, the sky that had started thinking about morning thinks better of it, and goes back to being night.
